  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/858897/description_1cbdae2f-1bac-4be7-8390-8eb7f9f5473f.png\" alt=\"创造太空\"></p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>描述：</strong></span></h1><h3>创造太空是一款模组，让你能够使用机械装置制造火箭，前往其他星球。准备好设计一款受真实科学启发的火箭吧。</h3><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>从1.7.10版本开始，本模组需要Create 6.+版本。</p><p>本模组与Create: Interactive基本兼容，但仅限1.7.8或更高版本。下方链接中有一则视频展示了兼容性，并针对可能遇到的少量bug提供了临时解决方案。</p><h1><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>链接：</strong></span></h1><h3><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">整合包</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> | <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmGPNKI1yYyWReLQRCG8V4g\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> | <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Dn9DhTqarH\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> |&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreating-space.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCreating_Space_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a></h3><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:560px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Bam0rIwZjJE\" width=\"560\" height=\"327\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></p><h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcreating-space.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fCreating_Space_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vRnG21r4Omk\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></a></h3><h2>来自工程师殖民地团队的作品：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-crowns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">皇冠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/ad-astra-creating-space-compatibility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra兼容性数据包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方整合包</a></li>\n</ul>",
